  steps:
  - headerText: Solve The Puzzle!
    bodyText: 'Welcome to the Entanglement tutorial!


      To complete this tutorial,
      you must reach the door at the top of the map. The door is currently locked.


      You
      must guide the 3 Tower Keys into the same force fields as their color. For
      example, Red Tower goes in the Red Force Field and so on.


      Use the power
      of entanglement to guide the keys and escape! Good luck!'
